{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50118","headline":"游仙窟诗 扬州青铜镜留与十娘 · 张文成","name":"游仙窟诗 扬州青铜镜留与十娘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仙人好负局，隐士屡潜观。\n映水菱花散，临风竹影寒。\n月下时惊鹊，池边独舞鸾。\n若道人心变，从渠照胆看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张文成","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50118.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50118","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}